# Build context for infra/docker/Dockerfile.* — the context is the repo root.
#
# Everything here is either rebuilt inside the image or has no business in it.
# Left out, the context is hundreds of megabytes of Next build caches and
# installed node_modules, and Railway uploads all of it on every deploy.
#
# NOTE: packages/ is NOT excluded. It is the committed source of the shared
# packages' build output, and `workspace:*` resolves to it. Without it the
# install fails.

**/node_modules
.git
.gitignore

# Build output.
#
# NEVER add a bare `**/dist` rule here. packages/*/dist IS the built package —
# `main` and `types` point straight into it — and excluding it is not a smaller
# image, it is 90 TS2307 errors on `@injishi/auth` and `@injishi/contracts` at
# `nest build`. Every rule below is scoped to a workspace directory, the same
# way .gitignore scopes its own, so packages/ is never swept up.
apps/*/dist
server/*/dist
apps/*/.next
apps/*/.next-prod
apps/*/.next-build
apps/*/.turbo
apps/*/.expo
apps/*/out
apps/*/build
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local state and secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.vercel
.pnpm-store
**/coverage

# Editor / AI context
.claude
.claude.json
.cursor
.vscode
.idea
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

# Docs that no image needs
docs
